---
description: Let a running agent finish before a later instruction applies
alwaysApply: true
---

New instructions are not retroactive. Let every running agent finish the task it was given.
Queue a later independent task until that agent finishes. An explicit correction of the
action already being performed applies at once, including a limit on what that action may
send or change. Stop or redirect a running agent only when the user explicitly says to
stop that agent or to change its current task.
